    "beat": 1,
    "flux": "A weathered female lighthouse keeper in oilskin and rain-soaked hair kneels on a gray rocky shore at dawn, lifting a drenched net in which a small silver-blue fish glows with soft bioluminescent cyan. Low-angle cinematic composition with the keeper on the left and the fish center-right, framed by dark wave foam and the distant lighthouse silhouette. 50mm lens, shallow depth of field, volumetric mist, cool blue palette with warm rose horizon, realistic painterly film still, wet textures, subtle rim light from first sunrise, high detail, no text.",
    "ltx": "The keeper's wet hair strands tremble as she pulls the net; the glowing fish flexes inside the mesh, pulses of cyan light ripple across the water. Camera starts close on the net, slowly tilts up to her face, then a gentle push-in toward the fish. Pacing is slow and contemplative, with tiny wave crashes. No music, no speech, no dialogue, only implied ambient stillness."
  },
  {
    "beat": 2,
    "flux": "A determined female lighthouse keeper climbs a narrow circular stone staircase inside a lighthouse, cradling a glass jar containing a luminous fish against her chest. The jar emits a soft turquoise glow that wraps her rain-dark coat and highlights the worn iron handrail. Vertical composition with the spiral stairs curving from bottom left to upper right, creating a helical path toward a dark opening. 35mm lens, slight low angle, dynamic diagonal lines, moody indigo and slate palette with warm amber accents from the jar, cinematic realism, dramatic shadow, storm-eroded textures, high detail, no text.",
    "ltx": "Rain lashes outside as the keeper climbs the spiral stairs; her coat sways, bootsteps rotate around the tight curve, and the jar's fish pulses brighter with each step. Camera follows in a smooth spiral tracking shot, descending slightly to ascend with her, then tilts up to the storm-filled doorway. Pacing builds from measured to urgent. No music, no speech, no dialogue."
  },
  {
    "beat": 3,
    "flux": "The lighthouse keeper stands in a circular lamp room, hands raised near a brass lantern housing; the glowing fish in a glass jar floats above her palms, emitting radiant gold light that floods the chamber. The great lens refracts the glow into sharp golden rays crossing salt-mist and polished brass. Central symmetrical composition, keeper low in frame, beam rising upward through the curved window. 24mm wide lens, deep perspective, luminous palette of gold, amber, ivory, and deep teal shadows, epic cinematic fantasy-realism, volumetric light, detailed machinery, high contrast, no text.",
    "ltx": "The jar's fish spirals gently above the keeper's hands, its glow swelling until it overpowers the lamp's ordinary white light. The lens ignites, golden light expands through glass prisms, and the beam rotates outward in slow majestic arcs. Camera starts on the fish, pulls back to reveal the lamp room, then rises through the window with the beam. Pacing builds to a luminous crescendo. No music, no speech, no dialogue."
  },
  {
    "beat": 4,
    "flux": "A battered dark-hulled sailing ship with a torn sail drifts near jagged black rocks under a moonlit stormy sea, guided by a powerful golden lighthouse beam sweeping across the water. The beam strikes the ship's wet rigging, turning spray into shimmering gold. Wide establishing composition with the ship center-right, rocks foreground left, lighthouse beam entering from upper left. 85mm cinematic lens, deep depth of field, dramatic chiaroscuro, palette of midnight blue, slate gray, storm white, and molten gold, epic seafaring realism, detailed foam and lightning, no text.",
    "ltx": "The ship shudders through waves as its tattered sail billows; the gold beam sweeps across the sea, illuminating rocks, spray, and the hull just long enough for the crew to steer. Camera follows the ship from a high oblique angle, tracking it through a narrow gap between rocks, then widens as it passes safely. Pacing is tense, then releases into steady momentum. No music, no speech, no dialogue."
  }
